<http://villainscope.org/villain/villain_movie_0140> <http://villainscope.org/villain/personalityDetails> "Bureaucratic Arrogance: Masking professional incompetence with an elitist and condescending attitude toward colleagues and subordinates. | Vengeful Pettiness: Prioritizing personal grudges and professional jealousy over the integrity of judicial investigations and the pursuit of truth. | Moral Bankruptcy: Abandoning justice and shielding violent criminals to secure institutional power and political favors. | Political Opportunism: Exploiting state-sponsored violence and political turmoil to eliminate rivals and solidify personal authority. | Elite Pretentiousness: Maintaining a facade of intellectual superiority to evade accountability for moral failures and professional negligence." .
