<http://villainscope.org/villain/villain_movie_0119> <http://villainscope.org/villain/personalityDetails> "Rebirth: Erasing the original persona of Jonathan Crane to fully embrace the \"Scarecrow\" identity as a defense mechanism against irreversible mental trauma. | Phobic Weaponization: Deriving authority and control by identifying and exploiting the deepest primal phobias of targets." .
