<http://villainscope.org/villain/villain_movie_0144> <http://schema.org/description> "Institutional Bigotry: Utilizing police authority to systematically harass and oppress marginalized groups based on racial and homophobic prejudices. | Volatile Aggression: Exhibiting explosive, uncontrolled outbursts of violence and physical assault as a primary response to emotional stress or perceived disrespect. | Emotional Immaturity: Demonstrating stunted psychological growth and a pathological, codependent relationship with an overbearing maternal figure. | Corrupt Incompetence: Neglecting professional law enforcement duties and ethical standards in favor of personal biases and alcoholic escapism." .
