<http://villainscope.org/villain/villain_movie_0117> <http://villainscope.org/villain/personalityDetails> "Eloquent speaker: Persuades others well | Delusional Denial: Refusing to acknowledge the imminent military defeat and commanding non-existent forces to maintain a collapsing reality. | Volatile Explosiveness: Exhibiting unpredictable and violent outbursts of rage toward subordinates perceived as traitors or failures. | Ruthless Fatalism: Demanding the total sacrifice of the civilian population, viewing the people's survival as irrelevant after the regime's failure. | Megalomaniacal Victimhood: Combining a grandiose sense of historical destiny with profound self-pity, blaming the world and internal betrayals for personal failures. | Manipulative Authority: Maintaining a terrifying yet magnetic command that compels absolute loyalty and collective self-destruction among followers." .
