<http://villainscope.org/villain/villain_movie_0049> <http://schema.org/description> "Pessimism: Extremely pessimistic about love | Role: Guides deceased souls from the sea to the afterlife | Cheerful: Makes jokes | Authority: Maintaining a reign of terror aboard the Flying Dutchman through physical brutality and a rigid, inescapable hierarchy." .
