<http://villainscope.org/villain/villain_movie_0174> <http://villainscope.org/villain/personalityDetails> "Deception: Utilizing a high-pitched, sing-song voice and the promise of free sweets (lollipops, treacle tart) to exploit children’s innocence and desires. | Sadistic: Deriving overt pleasure from the terror of his victims, viewing the capture of children not just as a job for the Baroness, but as a deeply gratifying personal sport. | Obsession: Possessing a pathological focus on the \"scent\" of children, which he uses to dehumanize them into mere prey to be scented and bagged. | Loyalty: Operating as the official enforcement arm of the Vulgarian regime's anti-child laws, showing total compliance with authority while exercising his own brand of cruelty." .
