<http://villainscope.org/villain/villain_movie_0156> <http://schema.org/description> "Nihilistic: Viewing human beings from a moral and physical height as insignificant \"dots,\" making their suffering and death (via diluted penicillin) a matter of simple arithmetic. | Narcissism: Possessing zero genuine loyalty, willing to fake his own death and betray those who loved him (e.g., Anna Schmidt and Holly Martins) for financial gain and survival." .
